    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "The output dimensions of a captured image are set at the moment of capture, depending on device orientation and capture session configuration.",
      "ko": "캡처된 이미지의 출력 차원은 캡처 시점에 장치 방향과 캡처 세션 구성에 따라 설정됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "313e3929c576aface2c4102760343b01fac14fc528bc205810e7d501c8f21348",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "(For example, when the capture session includes a video output and video stabilization is in use, captured photos are smaller.)",
      "ko": "(예를 들어 캡처 세션에 비디오 출력이 포함되고 비디오 안정화가 사용 중이면 캡처된 사진이 더 작아집니다.)",
      "sourceHash": "c1b9f76172e9530d5abbf2d00453c32b3adb3dc4096093dab52eb9492249e3e6",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "This property provides the dimensions of the image to be delivered in the [`photoOutput(_:didFinishProcessingPhoto:error:)`](avcapturephotocapturedelegate/photooutput(_:didfinishprocessingphoto:error:).md) method.",
      "ko": "The value of this property is [`invalid`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/CMTime/invalid) if the track can’t calculate its minimum frame duration, or if it’s unknown.",
      "sourceHash": "dc2a60d000aa4dfdb315fc1eb70426a511cf93f0dbca1486792106457a99bfe1",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0002",
      "source": "Use this property in earlier delegate methods to find the size of the image before delivery.",
      "ko": "이 속성은 전달되기 전에 이미지 크기를 확인하려고 이전 delegate 메서드에서 사용합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "465dcd198c566662fc619aa83966748e4fce40698b955c23030aa1047e21ccbc",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "If you do not request capture in RAW format, this property’s value has zero width and zero height.",
      "ko": "Use the filtering methods [`AVMediaSelectionGroup`](avmediaselectiongroup.md) defines to filter the group’s options according to playability, locale, and additional media characteristics.",
      "sourceHash": "35613518b86c1b0ba0429c7fe523e945f91f3eef3f07e036cd747b101eb702a4",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
